# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
#
# Only needed when ExperimentConfig.llm_provider="anthropic" (the
# default — see src/agents/llm_client.py). The Anthropic Python SDK
# reads ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from the environment automatically (via
# anthropic.Anthropic()) — no other wiring is needed. Unit tests never
# require this: they use a fake LLMClient. It is only required to run
# experiments/run_rag_smoke_test.py (and similar) against the real API.
#
# NOT needed when llm_provider="ollama" (Pre-Milestone 14A checkpoint):
# OllamaLLMClient talks to a locally hosted, unauthenticated Ollama
# server instead (see "LLM Providers" in README.md) — no API key at all.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
